sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant H as Harness
  participant K as Hook: node java-hooks.mjs
  participant M as Model

  U->>H: opens a session in the project folder
  H->>K: SessionStart, source = startup
  K-->>H: stdout: project passport, plus the router in Claude and Codex
  H->>M: system context + passport

  U->>H: message
  H->>K: UserPromptSubmit, prompt
  K-->>H: additionalContext: anchor in GigaCode, otherwise empty
  H->>M: message + anchor

  M->>H: Write call for OrderService.java
  H->>K: PreToolUse, tool_name and tool_input
  alt new hard violation
    K-->>H: exit 2, stderr: [forbxpg-java] J1 ...
    H-->>M: tool not run, refusal text
    M->>H: corrected Write
    H->>K: PreToolUse
  end
  K-->>H: exit 0
  H->>H: writes the file to disk
  H->>K: PostToolUse
  K-->>H: additionalContext: W remarks and role rules
  H->>M: tool result + additionalContext

  M->>H: ends the turn
  H->>K: Stop
  K->>K: mvn -q -o compile for the affected modules
  alt compile errors in this session's files
    K-->>H: decision = block, reason = list of errors
    H->>M: reason as an instruction to continue
    M->>H: fixes, then ends the turn again
  else build passed
    K-->>H: empty
    H->>U: model's answer
  end
